よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@watagashi_luck/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed8d2d03/uploads/origins/902212d2-b897-440c-8f6e-2a77a1a04a1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=487df8abf19fb6bbc23a55abc4688ed1", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed8d2d03/uploads/origins/902212d2-b897-440c-8f6e-2a77a1a04a1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=487df8abf19fb6bbc23a55abc4688ed1, https://si.imgix.net/ed8d2d03/uploads/origins/902212d2-b897-440c-8f6e-2a77a1a04a1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b3133fc8afa0402011b787e089917b18 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed8d2d03/uploads/origins/902212d2-b897-440c-8f6e-2a77a1a04a1d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f2222e2b3a1d0900ca84ea9c3910b5b0 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！アピールありがとうございます絵が可愛くてとても好きです〜。\nリクエストしたいのですがこのキャラクターを描いていただけませんか？\nhttps://i.imgur.com/mZvFbw6.png\n\nどんな構図でもOKです!\nありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@watagashi_luck/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/992f8ad5/uploads/origins/d1feb026-b7a2-49a8-91b5-1fd5bdeeee44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e016f78df6e217e8f6ffa65232d2af0c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/992f8ad5/uploads/origins/d1feb026-b7a2-49a8-91b5-1fd5bdeeee44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e016f78df6e217e8f6ffa65232d2af0c, https://si.imgix.net/992f8ad5/uploads/origins/d1feb026-b7a2-49a8-91b5-1fd5bdeeee44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e3d5853bae13c875c6c02ef8303cc55 2x, https://si.imgix.net/992f8ad5/uploads/origins/d1feb026-b7a2-49a8-91b5-1fd5bdeeee44?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=907f11b3b65ed0016a2688fb77f477cd 3x", "genre": "art", 